        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t index="1" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:03,445</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:05,419</end-time>
                <translation>我的臣民们啊</translation>
                <original>我が民らよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="2" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:05,419</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:08,393</end-time>
                <translation>无人不知其名的俄狄浦斯我</translation>
                <original>人皆にその名も隠れなきオイディプスが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="3" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:08,393</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:10,152</end-time>
                <translation>亲自驾临于此</translation>
                <original>自ら直々ここへやって参った</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="4" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:12,459</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:16,140</end-time>
                <translation>在那遥远的古希腊剧场上演的</translation>
                <original>はるか古代ギリシャの劇場で上演された</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="5" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:16,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:19,225</end-time>
                <translation>悲剧杰作《俄狄浦斯王》</translation>
                <original>悲劇の傑作オイディプス王</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="6" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:22,362</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:27,132</end-time>
                <translation>挑战袭击都城灾祸之谜的英雄俄狄浦斯</translation>
                <original>都を襲う災いの謎に挑んだ英雄オイディプス</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="7" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:29,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:31,382</end-time>
                <translation>然而他的热情</translation>
                <original>しかし彼の情熱が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="8" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:31,452</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:36,222</end-time>
                <translation>却讽刺地揭开了自己受诅咒的身世</translation>
                <original>皮肉にも自らの呪われた出自を明らかにしてしまいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="9" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:39,772</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:42,032</end-time>
                <translation>面对超越人类理解范围的命运
人知を超えた運命に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="10" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:42,032</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:44,963</end-time>
                <translation>人该如何应对呢？</translation>
                <original>人はどのように向き合うことができるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="11" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:46,412</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:49,945</end-time>
                <translation>这是一部向现代的我们提出质问的作品</translation>
                <original>現代の我々にも問いかけてくる作品だと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="12" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:49,945</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:51,922</end-time>
                <translation>便是岛田雅彦老师的观点</translation>
                <original>島田雅彦さんは語ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="13" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:53,492</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:55,522</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著</translation>
                <original>100分de名著</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="14" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:55,522</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:59,262</end-time>
                <translation>本期将通过《俄狄浦斯王》解读人类的本质</translation>
                <original>オイディプス王から人間の本質を読み解きます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="15" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:20,906</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:25,840</end-time>
                <translation>第1回 如何面对命运？
第1回　運命とどう向き合うか？</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="16" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:27,352</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:29,725</end-time>
                <translation>《100分de名著》的主持人武内陶子
100分de名著司会の武内陶子です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="17" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:29,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:30,483</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="18" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:30,483</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:32,915</end-time>
                <translation>好 本次我们要读的名著是这本</translation>
                <original>さあ今回からの名著はこちらです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="19" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:33,572</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:35,472</end-time>
                <translation>《俄狄浦斯王》</translation>
                <original>オイディプス王</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="20" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:36,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,853</end-time>
                <translation>我完全没听说过</translation>
                <original>全く聞いた事は無いです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="21" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:38,853</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:39,807</end-time>
                <translation>诶 真的吗？</translation>
                <original>ええ本当ですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="22" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:39,807</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,417</end-time>
                <translation>在比方里遇到过呀</translation>
                <original>なにかのたとえとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="23" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:41,417</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:42,977</end-time>
                <translation>或是稍微听人引用过呀</translation>
                <original>なんかちょっとだけ引用されるとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="24" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:42,977</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:46,004</end-time>
                <translation>这类的印象是一点都没有</translation>
                <original>なんとなく耳覚えとかそのすべてが無いぐらい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="25" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:46,004</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:48,532</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯王 初次见面请多多指教 国王大人</translation>
                <original>オイディプス王はじめまして王様</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="26" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:50,227</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:52,195</end-time>
                <translation>这个呢 是2500年前</translation>
                <original>これあの2500年前</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="27" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:52,195</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:55,871</end-time>
                <translation>在古希腊上演的戏剧</translation>
                <original>古代ギリシャで演じられた演劇でございまして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="28" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:55,871</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:00,972</end-time>
                <translation>放在希腊戏剧中也是杰作中的杰作</translation>
                <original>ギリシャ演劇の中でも傑作中の傑作と言われている作品なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="29" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:00,972</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:03,606</end-time>
                <translation>不过我之前不知道原来它是戏剧剧本</translation>
                <original>私戯曲だってことはちょっと知らなかったんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="30" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:03,606</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:04,240</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="31" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:04,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:06,142</end-time>
                <translation>我也是刚才也从工作人员听到的</translation>
                <original>私もさっきスタッフからどうもそうらしい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="32" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:06,142</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:07,860</end-time>
                <translation>只是知道了点提示</translation>
                <original>というヒントだけがもらえましたけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="33" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:07,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,346</end-time>
                <translation>那么 有请为我们解读《俄狄浦斯王》魅力的</translation>
                <original>それではオイディプス王の魅力を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="34" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:10,346</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:12,693</end-time>
                <translation>本期的指导老师吧</translation>
                <original>紐解いてくださる先生ご紹介いたしましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="35" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:12,693</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:15,362</end-time>
                <translation>作家岛田雅彦老师 有请</translation>
                <original>作家の島田雅彦さんですどうぞ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="36" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:17,142</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:20,018</end-time>
                <translation>请多关照</translation>
                <original>よろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="37" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:20,018</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:23,498</end-time>
                <translation>岛田老师 这部《俄狄浦斯王》真的那么厉害吗？</translation>
                <original>島田さんこのオイディプス王そんなにすごいんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="38" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:23,498</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:25,387</end-time>
                <translation>从篇幅上看 它就是薄薄的一本呢</translation>
                <original>まあ分量的にはこんな薄いんなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="39" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:25,387</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:27,518</end-time>
                <translation>对对对 这么薄</translation>
                <original>そうそうそうこんな薄いん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="40" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:27,518</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,634</end-time>
                <translation>所以大概就一百页左右</translation>
                <original>だから百ページぐらいですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="41" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:29,634</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:32,764</end-time>
                <translation>上下班往返路上就能读完</translation>
                <original>通勤の往復でもう読めちゃうんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="42" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:32,764</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:34,320</end-time>
                <translation>但就在这薄薄一本里</translation>
                <original>まあそこのこの中に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="43" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:34,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:39,375</end-time>
                <translation>是满满地创想 嗯…也就是文学</translation>
                <original>ぎっしりともうあのフィクションああまあ文学</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="44" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:39,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:43,807</end-time>
                <translation>他们所有要素都包含在内 可谓一应俱全</translation>
                <original>すべての要素が入っているとオールインワン</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="45" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:43,807</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:45,815</end-time>
                <translation>有点令人难以置信的是</translation>
                <original>もうなんかちょっとにわかに信じ難いのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="46" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:45,815</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:48,180</end-time>
                <translation>在2500年前那时候</translation>
                <original>その2500年前の段階で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="47" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:48,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:50,718</end-time>
                <translation>就已经有了这样一部一应俱全的作品</translation>
