            <t index="115" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:05:46,213</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:48,165</end-time>
                <translation>神话也同样如此</translation>
                <original>まぁ神話も同様です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="116" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:05:48,165</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:50,708</end-time>
                <translation>所以基本上 故事这种东西</translation>
                <original>だからこれは基本的にその物語っていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="117" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:05:50,708</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:54,045</end-time>
                <translation>原本是由一位说书人单独讲述的</translation>
                <original>語り部が一人で語るものだったんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="118" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:05:54,045</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:58,566</end-time>
                <translation>而在这类剧作中 会有多个登场人物出现</translation>
                <original>ここにきて複数の登場人物を出して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="119" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:05:58,566</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:02,193</end-time>
                <translation>此外还有被称为“歌队”的</translation>
                <original>でさらにはコロスっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="120" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:02,193</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:04,824</end-time>
                <translation>类似群众演员的人们</translation>
                <original>えエキストラみたいな人たちがいて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="121" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:04,824</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:07,998</end-time>
                <translation>他们一边关注着剧情的发展</translation>
                <original>で劇の進行を見守りつつ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="122" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:07,998</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:10,101</end-time>
                <translation>一边以类似歌剧合唱的形式</translation>
                <original>オペラの合唱に当たるような形で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="123" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:10,101</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:15,578</end-time>
                <translation>将旁白性质的内容穿插其中</translation>
                <original>ええナレーション的なものを 挿入したりという形で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="124" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:15,578</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:19,394</end-time>
                <translation>就这样 将原本单一叙述的形式</translation>
                <original>とてもその対話的そしてあの複声的</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="125" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:19,394</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:21,849</end-time>
                <translation>即拥有多种声音的 多声性</translation>
                <original>声がたくさんある多声的</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="126" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:21,849</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:24,305</end-time>
                <translation>转变为了极具对话性、复声性的表现形式</translation>
                <original>なものに変えていったという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="127" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:24,305</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:27,636</end-time>
                <translation>这就像在日本 原本由僧侣讲述佛法</translation>
                <original>日本で言うとこお坊さんとかがありがたい話をしたりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="128" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:27,636</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:29,505</end-time>
                <translation>或讲述古老历史故事的形式</translation>
                <original>まあ古い歴史の話をしてたのを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="129" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:29,505</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:31,470</end-time>
                <translation>逐渐由一个人将其改编成戏剧形式</translation>
                <original>ちょっとそれを一人で芝居仕立てにして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="130" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:31,470</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:32,968</end-time>
                <translation>这就有点像落语的雏形</translation>
                <original>それがちょっと落語になって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="131" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:32,968</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:34,744</end-time>
                <translation>然后大家觉得与其一个人表演落语</translation>
                <original>でその落語を一人でやるよりは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="132" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:34,744</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:36,696</end-time>
                <translation>不如很多人一起表演更容易理解</translation>
                <original>大勢でやったほうがわかるじゃんみたいになって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="133" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:36,696</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:38,000</end-time>
                <translation>然后就变成喜剧了戏剧</translation>
                <original>その劇ができていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="134" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:38,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:39,441</end-time>
                <translation>道理是一样的</translation>
                <original>みたいなことと一緒です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="135" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:39,441</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:40,990</end-time>
                <translation>确实很像呢</translation>
                <original>まあ似ていますねえ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="136" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:40,990</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:43,558</end-time>
                <translation>虽说是希腊悲剧的杰作</translation>
                <original>ギリシャ悲劇の傑作って言いますけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="137" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:43,558</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:45,926</end-time>
                <translation>但让人感动落泪的就是悲剧么？</translation>
                <original>泣けるのが悲劇でいいんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="138" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:45,926</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:46,921</end-time>
                <translation>所谓悲剧</translation>
                <original>悲劇っていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="139" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:46,921</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:53,078</end-time>
                <translation>是讲述那些配得上英雄之名的登场人物</translation>
                <original>まあ英雄と言う名に相応しいようなその登場人物が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="140" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:53,078</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:56,667</end-time>
                <translation>所经历的考验</translation>
                <original>味わうまあ試練</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="141" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:56,667</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:59,739</end-time>
                <translation>以及他们如何克服这些考验</translation>
                <original>でそれをいかに克服するかといった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="142" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:59,739</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:01,604</end-time>
                <translation>诸如此类的内容</translation>
                <original>そういう内容で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="143" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:01,604</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:04,839</end-time>
                <translation>主人公将如何面对危机</translation>
                <original>主人公がではどのようにその危機に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="144" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:04,839</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:06,741</end-time>
                <translation>或者说如何面对考验</translation>
                <original>あるいは試練に立ち向かっていくのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="145" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:06,741</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:09,234</end-time>
                <translation>人们带着很强的教诲意义</translation>
                <original>と言うことをまあかなり教訓的に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="146" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:09,234</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:12,118</end-time>
                <translation>去体会并欣赏这一点</translation>
                <original>受け止めながら楽しむという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="147" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:12,118</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:13,983</end-time>
                <translation>但那种永远哭哭啼啼的</translation>
                <original>でも永遠とメソメソしているものが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="148" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:13,983</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:14,913</end-time>
                <translation>并非悲剧</translation>
                <original>悲劇というわけではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="149" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:14,913</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:15,952</end-time>
                <translation>不是悲剧</translation>
                <original>悲劇ではなくって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="150" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:15,952</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:20,177</end-time>
                <translation>而是登场人物要更为坚强的才算</translation>
                <original>まあもっと登場人物たちはですね 強いですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="151" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:20,177</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:26,448</end-time>
                <translation>亚里士多德先生对悲剧是这样定义的</translation>
                <original>アリストテレスさんはその悲劇をこのように定義しているのでございます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="152" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:26,448</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:30,290</end-time>
                <translation>悲剧是对某种宏大的</translation>
                <original>悲劇とは一定の大きさを備え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="153" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:30,290</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:35,262</end-time>
                <translation>完整且高尚行为的再现（摹仿）</translation>
                <original>完結した高貴な行為の再現（ミメーシス）であり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="154" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:35,262</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:37,173</end-time>
                <translation>不是通过叙述</translation>
                <original>叙述によってではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="155" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:37,173</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:40,236</end-time>
                <translation>而是由行动中的人物来进行</translation>
                <original>行為する人物たちによって行われ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="156" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:40,236</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:42,376</end-time>
                <translation>通过怜悯与恐惧</translation>
                <original>憐れみと恐れを通じて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="157" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:42,376</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:47,993</end-time>
                <translation>达成这类情感的净化（卡塔西斯）</translation>
                <original>そのような感情の浄化(カタルシス)を達成するものである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="158" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:47,993</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:50,520</end-time>
                <translation>所谓由行动中的人物来进行</translation>
                <original>行為する人物たちによって行われての</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="159" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:50,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:51,267</end-time>
                <translation>就是指这些演员们</translation>
                <original>この役者さん達</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="160" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:51,267</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:52,955</end-time>
