神話の登場人物とか神々</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="164" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:00,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:04,691</end-time>
                <translation>这是由活生生的人来扮演</translation>
                <original>これを生身の人間が演じるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="165" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:04,691</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:06,736</end-time>
                <translation>总之就是用自己的身体</translation>
                <original>要するに自分の体を使って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="166" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:06,736</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:11,440</end-time>
