            <t index="178" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:48,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:52,650</end-time>
                <translation>《俄狄浦斯王》的前传故事</translation>
                <original>『オイディプス王』前段の物語</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="179" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:53,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:56,936</end-time>
                <translation>其实 在阅读这部《俄狄浦斯王》时</translation>
                <original>でね実はこのオイディプス王を読むにあたっても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="180" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:56,936</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,593</end-time>
                <translation>也需要一些预备知识呢 岛田老师？</translation>
                <original>ちょっとこれ予備知識が必要なんですよね島田さん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="181" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:59,593</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:00,423</end-time>
                <translation>是呢</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="182" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:00,423</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:03,522</end-time>
                <translation>正篇非常短</translation>
                <original>本編は極めて短いもので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="183" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:03,522</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:06,940</end-time>
                <translation>它只描绘了事件的尾声部分</translation>
                <original>それで出来事のですねあのーまあ終盤の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="184" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:06,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:10,209</end-time>
                <translation>极其有限的时间内发生的事情</translation>
                <original>ごく限られた時間に起きることだけを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="185" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:10,209</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,959</end-time>
                <translation>只描述了一小部分</translation>
                <original>あのう描いているので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="186" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:11,959</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:13,848</end-time>
                <translation>观众们</translation>
                <original>で観客の方をですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="187" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:13,848</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:16,341</end-time>
                <translation>可以说是对前传故事</translation>
                <original>その前日談と言いますか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="188" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:16,341</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:18,574</end-time>
                <translation>也就是导致这一结局的过程</translation>
                <original>ええそこに至るまでのプロセスをですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="189" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:18,574</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:20,602</end-time>
                <translation>是预先了解后再来观看的</translation>
                <original>あらかじめ了解して見てるんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="190" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:20,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:23,531</end-time>
                <translation>是当时的人们都知道的故事</translation>
                <original>当時の人みんな知ってる話</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="191" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:23,531</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,793</end-time>
                <translation>那么 接下来</translation>
                <original>さあそれではですねそのオイディプス王の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="192" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:26,793</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:29,362</end-time>
                <translation>我们先来看看
前提となる物語を</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="193" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:29,362</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,767</end-time>
                <translation>《俄狄浦斯王》的前提故事</translation>
                <original>まずは見てみたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="194" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:33,742</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:37,458</end-time>
                <translation>在远古的希腊 忒拜国王拉伊俄斯</translation>
                <original>太古のギリシャテバイ王ライオスは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="195" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:37,458</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:39,992</end-time>
                <translation>曾接到一则不祥的神谕</translation>
                <original>ある時不吉な神託を受けます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="196" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:41,902</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:45,417</end-time>
                <translation>如果他与王妃生下儿子</translation>
                <original>王妃との間に息子が生まれたならば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="197" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:45,417</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:50,332</end-time>
                <translation>那个儿子将会杀死国王 并娶国王的妻子为妻</translation>
                <original>その息子は王を殺し王の后を妻とするだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="198" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:53,377</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:55,856</end-time>
                <translation>畏惧神谕的拉伊俄斯王</translation>
                <original>神託恐れたライオス王は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="199" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:55,856</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:58,881</end-time>
                <translation>残忍地将刚出生的男婴的脚踝</translation>
                <original>非情にも生まれた男の子のくるぶしを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="200" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:58,881</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:00,754</end-time>
                <translation>用别针刺穿</translation>
                <original>ピンで串刺しにし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="201" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:00,754</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:02,452</end-time>
                <translation>命人将他丢弃在山中</translation>
                <original>山中に捨てさせました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="202" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:09,573</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:12,276</end-time>
                <translation>然而 由于命运的捉弄</translation>
                <original>しかし運命のいたずらによって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="203" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:12,276</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:15,652</end-time>
                <translation>这个孩子被南方科林斯国王夫妇收养了</translation>
                <original>この子は南方 コリントス王夫妻に引き取られます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="204" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:17,666</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:21,254</end-time>
                <translation>然后作为科林斯的王子俄狄浦斯</translation>
                <original>そしてコリントスの王子オイディプスとして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="205" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:21,254</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:23,402</end-time>
                <translation>茁壮地成长了起来</translation>
                <original>たくましく成長して行きました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="206" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:26,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:29,140</end-time>
                <translation>有一天 俄狄浦斯也收到了神谕</translation>
                <original>そんなオイディプスにもあるひ神託が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="207" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:31,195</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:34,822</end-time>
                <translation>想必你将弑父娶母</translation>
                <original>父を殺し母と交わるだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="208" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:37,642</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:41,856</end-time>
                <translation>深信科林斯国王夫妇就是自己亲生父母的俄狄浦斯</translation>
                <original>コリントス王夫妻を 実の父母と信じるオイディプスは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="209" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:41,856</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:44,550</end-time>
                <translation>为了逃避这可怕的预言</translation>
                <original>恐ろしい預言から逃れようと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="210" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:44,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:47,266</end-time>
                <translation>就这样踏上了流浪的旅途</translation>
                <original>そのまま放浪の旅に出ました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="211" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:48,752</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:52,698</end-time>
                <translation>在途中一个三岔路口</translation>
                <original>その途中道が三股に分かれるところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="212" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:52,698</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:54,932</end-time>
                <translation>他遇到了一位老人和他的随从</translation>
                <original>ある老人の一行と出会います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="213" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:56,182</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:57,973</end-time>
                <translation>“让开！”
道を譲れ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="214" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:57,973</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:01,112</end-time>
                <translation>被随从粗暴对待的俄狄浦斯</translation>
                <original>と家来から乱暴に扱われたオイディプス</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="215" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:02,482</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:03,980</end-time>
                <translation>在盛怒之下</translation>
                <original>怒りにまかせて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="216" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:03,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:06,962</end-time>
                <translation>将老人连同随从一起杀死了</translation>
                <original>家来もろとも老人を殺してしまいました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="217" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:08,412</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:13,890</end-time>
                <translation>其实这位老人正是他的亲生父亲拉伊俄斯</translation>
                <original>実はこの老人こそが本当の父親ライオスだったのですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="218" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:13,890</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:16,832</end-time>
                <translation>但俄狄浦斯对此无从知晓</translation>
                <original>オイディプスはそれを知る由もありませんでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="219" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:19,670</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:22,131</end-time>
                <translation>失去了国王的底比斯城</translation>
                <original>王を失ったテバイの都に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="220" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:22,131</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:23,772</end-time>
                <translation>又遭遇了更大的灾难</translation>
                <original>さらなる災難が襲います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="221" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:25,672</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:28,107</end-time>
                <translation>怪物斯芬克斯出现了</translation>
                <original>怪物スフィンクスが現れ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="222" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:28,107</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:30,374</end-time>
                <translation>它向遇到的人出谜题</translation>
                <original>出会った人になぞかけをしては</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="223" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:30,374</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:32,141</end-time>
                <translation>将答不上来的人</translation>
                <original>答えられない人々を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="224" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:32,141</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:35,096</end-time>
                <translation>一个接一个地吞食杀害</translation>
                <original>次々に喰い殺したのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="225" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:35,096</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:39,528</end-time>
                <translation>这时来到此地的是俄狄浦斯</translation>
                <original>そこへやってきたのがオイディプスでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="226" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:39,528</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:41,617</end-time>
                <translation>“有一种生物 它只有一种声音</translation>
                <original>一つの声を持ちながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="227" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:41,617</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:43,482</end-time>
                <translation>早晨用四条腿走路
朝は四本脚</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="228" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:43,482</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:45,308</end-time>
                <translation>中午用两条腿走路
昼は二本足</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="229" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:45,308</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:48,202</end-time>
                <translation>晚上用三条腿走路 这是什么？”
夜は三本足これは何か</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="230" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:51,405</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:53,317</end-time>
                <translation>“那是人”</translation>
                <original>それは人間だ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="231" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:53,317</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:55,345</end-time>
                <translation>人在幼年时用四条腿走路 
人間は幼くは四つ足で歩き</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="232" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:57,245</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:01,011</end-time>
                <translation>青年时期用两条腿走路 
青年期には二本足で歩き</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="233" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:01,011</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:02,787</end-time>
                <translation>年老后拄着拐杖走路</translation>
                <original>年老いては杖をついて歩く</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="234" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:05,116</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:06,840</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯漂亮地解开了谜题</translation>
                <original>見事謎を解き</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="235" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:06,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:09,574</end-time>
                <translation>打倒了斯芬克斯</translation>
                <original>スフィンクスを倒したオイディプス</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="236" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:09,574</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:11,752</end-time>
                <translation>被迎为忒拜的国王 </translation>
                <original>テバイの王として迎えられ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="237" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:11,752</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:15,050</end-time>
                <translation>与先王拉伊俄斯的妻子伊俄卡斯忒结婚 </translation>
                <original>先王ライオスの妻イオカステと結婚</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="238" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:15,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:17,302</end-time>
                <translation>生下了四个孩子</translation>
                <original>四人の子どもを儲けたのでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="239" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:19,543</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:20,389</end-time>
                <translation>很厉害呢</translation>
                <original>すごいですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="240" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:20,389</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:23,125</end-time>
                <translation>因不祥的神谕被遗弃 </translation>
                <original>不吉な神託を受けて捨てられ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="241" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:23,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:26,170</end-time>
