            <t index="411" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:20:27,474</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:29,791</end-time>
                <translation>知道事件的真相</translation>
                <original>事件の真相を知っているんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="412" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:20:29,791</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:34,098</end-time>
                <translation>“我绝不会说出这个不幸的秘密”</translation>
                <original>わしは決してこの不幸な秘密を明かしはしない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="413" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:20:34,098</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:35,651</end-time>
                <translation>“我既不想让自己</translation>
                <original>わしは自分をも</original>
