            <t index="447" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:04,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:07,409</end-time>
                <translation>也必须去面对</translation>
                <original>それに向き合わなければならないのだ</original>
