            <t index="449" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:09,447</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:12,205</end-time>
                <translation>我妻子是伊俄卡斯忒那种类型</translation>
                <original>うちのかみさんはイオカステタイプで</original>
